 reliability and latency disqualify this variant.' --variant-status compact_25 discarded 'Failed 5/13 development requests; valid cases still show semantic conflation.' --variant-status compact_31 discarded 'Superseded by stronger constraint-aware finalists; no winner at this stage.' --variant-status centrality discarded 'Useful candidate source, but standalone ranking was not the selected architecture.' --variant-status planned_union_fast31 discarded 'Superseded by compact packing and revised runtime; weak conjunctions and unverified generated reasons remain.' --variant-status baseline_union_fast31 discarded 'Efficient on already-covered requests but loses coverage on indirect or underspecified requests.' --variant-status planned_union_google_gemini_3_1_flash_lite_packing3 active 'Additional-model experiment; cheaper than the higher-cost experiment but still adds costs relative to original retrieval. Not an accepted replacement.' --variant-status planned_union_google_gemini_3_flash_preview_packing3 discarded 'Retained as quality comparison; generating reasons adds latency, cost and unverified assurances.' --variant-status planned_union_google_gemini_3_flash_preview_packing3_ids discarded 'Earlier IDs configuration failed car-chase output length; failure retained.' --variant-status planned_union_google_gemini_3_flash_preview_packing3_ids_v2 discarded '900-token configuration later failed fresh restaurant request; superseded by explicit minimal reasoning and larger output budget.' --variant-status planned_union_google_gemini_3_flash_preview_packing3_ids_v3_minimal active 'Higher-cost experiment only; additional planning, model cost and latency have not been accepted. Not a chosen default.' --summary 'The original 13 requests and six original retrieval variants are restored unchanged as the primary comparison. They reuse the same original interpretation and add no model calls. The later Flash pipeline is available only as a higher-cost experiment: it changes planning, candidate pools and filtering as well as reranking. Its additional cost and latency have not been accepted, and no overall winner is declared. Other requests and iterations remain supplemental history.' --original-comparison docs/prototypes/crate-evidence/comparison.json --cost-review docs/prototypes/crate-evidence/matched-comparison-metrics.json
